# ⛔ THE SCRIPT TEXT IS NEVER COMMITTED FROM HERE.
#
# This directory is a MATERIALISED COPY of ten named members of
# `tests/fixtures/pine_oos`, staged so the live journey harness can point at one
# directory. Six of the ten are on `pine_oos/.gitignore`'s withhold list —
# scripts whose recorded licence does not contemplate redistribution — and a
# copy is still a redistribution. So the whole set is ignored here rather than
# the six, because a per-file list in a second place is a second authority that
# would drift the first time the parity set changed.
#
# `README.md` names the ten and says how to re-materialise them.
*.pine
